1
00:01:48,351 --> 00:01:50,351


2
00:01:50,375 --> 00:01:52,375
♪ Hey-yah-ho ♪

3
00:01:52,399 --> 00:01:54,399
♪ Hey-yah-ho ♪

4
00:01:54,423 --> 00:01:55,977
♪ Hey-yah-ho ♪

5
00:01:56,002 --> 00:01:58,447
♪ Ooooohh-Hoy ♪

6
00:01:58,739 --> 00:02:03,061
♪ Asa kara ban made, ♪
From morning until night,

7
00:02:03,085 --> 00:02:07,138
♪ Futari ni tsunagarete! ♪
Chained two by two!

8
00:02:07,162 --> 00:02:09,162
♪ Yooooh ♪

9
00:02:09,186 --> 00:02:11,186
♪ Hey-yah-ho ♪

10
00:02:11,210 --> 00:02:12,643
♪ Hey-yah-ho ♪

11
00:02:12,667 --> 00:02:14,888
♪ Ooooohh-Hoy ♪

12
00:02:15,480 --> 00:02:22,939
♪Asa made fuchi ni, tatakarete! ♪
Beaten into the deep, until morning comes!

13
00:02:22,964 --> 00:02:23,480
♪ Ohhh ♪

14
00:02:23,504 --> 00:02:25,504
♪ Hey-yah-ho ♪

15
00:02:31,155 --> 00:02:32,160
Your Highness!

16
00:02:32,620 --> 00:02:33,920
Watch out!

17
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:35,440
You might you fall in the pond!

18
00:02:35,600 --> 00:02:37,060
Bye-bye!

19
00:02:38,100 --> 00:02:39,100
No, don't!

20
00:02:39,210 --> 00:02:40,240
You mustn't!

21
00:02:40,390 --> 00:02:42,360
Your Highness, please don't go!

22
00:02:45,820 --> 00:02:46,820
Nurse!

23
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:50,560
Are you okay?

24
00:02:52,260 --> 00:02:53,260
Look!

25
00:02:53,320 --> 00:02:54,640
There, I've caught you.

26
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:56,960
Today, there is a dance party on the ship.

27
00:02:57,144 --> 00:02:58,380
Hurry up and get ready.

28
00:02:58,580 --> 00:02:59,100
Come on, come on!

29
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:00,960
I hate dancing!

30
00:03:01,110 --> 00:03:02,259
No way—!

31
00:03:26,790 --> 00:03:27,790
Everyone!

32
00:03:28,490 --> 00:03:32,760
Prince Franz Charming from the neighboring kingdom has arrived incognito.

33
00:03:35,067 --> 00:03:36,333
Big deal.

34
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:48,560
Prince Franz!

35
00:03:49,100 --> 00:03:50,100
He's here!

36
00:03:52,600 --> 00:03:53,060
Wow!

37
00:03:53,061 --> 00:03:53,640
How interesting!

38
00:03:53,740 --> 00:03:55,160
Is this the greeting of this country?

39
00:03:56,220 --> 00:03:57,220
I like it!

40
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:12,294
Nice to meet you, Prince Sapphire.

41
00:04:12,319 --> 00:04:13,400
I'm Prince Franz.

42
00:04:15,460 --> 00:04:15,780
Hello!

43
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:17,360
Nice to meet you!

44
00:04:17,830 --> 00:04:18,940
Well, go on and dance!

45
00:04:20,290 --> 00:04:22,600
I really hate dancing, so I'll just watch!

46
00:04:22,905 --> 00:04:23,920
Let's eat sweets later!

47
00:04:25,050 --> 00:04:26,050
Prince Sapphire!

48
00:04:27,580 --> 00:04:29,260
Up we go!

49
00:04:34,500 --> 00:04:35,410
Prince Franz!

50
00:04:35,435 --> 00:04:37,000
I'll be watching from here, so go ahead and dance!

51
00:04:37,970 --> 00:04:38,970
What a strange guy.

52
00:04:39,080 --> 00:04:40,080
He's teasing me.

53
00:04:40,104 --> 00:04:40,780
Alright!

54
00:04:40,805 --> 00:04:41,805
I'm coming too!

55
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:51,000
Here I go!

56
00:05:00,250 --> 00:05:02,740
Prince Franz... no, Prince Sapphire...

57
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:08,340
Today is the day we find out for sure whether Prince Sapphire is a man or a woman!

58
00:05:08,520 --> 00:05:11,120
Everything will be fine this time, Grand Duke Duralumin.

59
00:05:11,280 --> 00:05:16,020
Prince Sapphire flies around wildly like that on purpose, but she is definitely a woman.

60
00:05:17,860 --> 00:05:19,940
How can you tell she's a girl?

61
00:05:21,145 --> 00:05:22,145
Are you listening, Grand Duke?

62
00:05:22,405 --> 00:05:25,660
How about having that Prince Franz look into it? What do you think?

63
00:05:26,085 --> 00:05:29,620
I see, that's interesting. Don't slip up.

64
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:38,920
Wow!

65
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:40,000
A ship!

66
00:05:44,640 --> 00:05:45,640
Thank you!

67
00:05:49,815 --> 00:05:51,900
What on earth is this "super secret business" about?

68
00:05:52,840 --> 00:05:54,308
Well, you see,

69
00:05:54,332 --> 00:05:57,626
it's actually regarding Prince Sapphire, whom you were playing with...

70
00:05:57,651 --> 00:05:58,840
he has a secret.

71
00:05:59,450 --> 00:06:00,700
A major secret.

72
00:06:00,965 --> 00:06:03,060
No one knows whether he's a boy or a girl.

73
00:06:03,250 --> 00:06:06,500
And so, Prince Franz, they would like you to investigate.

74
00:06:06,645 --> 00:06:08,313
You don't know if he's a boy or a girl?

75
00:06:09,440 --> 00:06:10,480
Well, that sounds like fun!

76
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:11,740
Alright!

77
00:06:14,970 --> 00:06:16,060
Lord Nylon is watching you.

78
00:06:16,341 --> 00:06:16,906
Uh-huh

79
00:06:17,130 --> 00:06:18,380
So be careful, okay?

80
00:06:18,430 --> 00:06:18,971
Mm-hmm

81
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:21,000
Hey, Sapphire.

82
00:06:21,860 --> 00:06:23,000
Are you eating a feast?

83
00:06:23,100 --> 00:06:26,079
You know, I heard something really good about you.

84
00:06:26,103 --> 00:06:28,680
What are you talking about!

85
00:06:29,420 --> 00:06:29,940
Whoa!

86
00:06:30,080 --> 00:06:31,280
Ah!

87
00:06:31,339 --> 00:06:32,866
Help!

88
00:06:34,840 --> 00:06:35,648
Hey, guys!

89
00:06:35,672 --> 00:06:36,380
Ah!

90
00:06:37,460 --> 00:06:38,620
Look at them all rowing...

91
00:06:45,599 --> 00:06:46,280
Faster, damn you!

92
00:06:48,479 --> 00:06:49,759
Keep rowing!

93
00:06:49,940 --> 00:06:52,306
Stay on course and put your backs into it!

94
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:14,880
♪ Asa kara yoru made yo... ♪
From morning until night...

95
00:07:20,660 --> 00:07:24,014
♪ Tabi ni tsunagare-tsu, mechi ni tatakare... ara! ♪
Chained to this voyage, beaten along the way...

96
00:07:24,546 --> 00:07:25,206
Row, row!

97
00:07:25,300 --> 00:07:25,900
No slacking!

98
00:07:26,180 --> 00:07:27,180
I'll skin you alive!

99
00:07:34,740 --> 00:07:36,580
What could have happened to these poor souls?

100
00:07:37,130 --> 00:07:39,000
They're all tied up and forced to work.

101
00:07:39,350 --> 00:07:40,350
That's strange.

102
00:07:43,793 --> 00:07:44,360
Hey!

103
00:07:44,400 --> 00:07:45,040
Row, row!

104
00:07:45,220 --> 00:07:46,660
If you row, you get to eat!

105
00:07:48,570 --> 00:07:49,680
Ah, I want to drink some water.

106
00:07:50,500 --> 00:07:51,500
Hey!

107
00:07:52,380 --> 00:07:53,466
You rat!

108
00:07:53,940 --> 00:07:55,380
I'm not a rat.

109
00:07:55,960 --> 00:07:57,420
I'm an angel named Tink.

110
00:07:57,980 --> 00:07:58,980
An angel?

111
00:07:59,080 --> 00:07:59,580
Really?

112
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:00,600
Are you really an angel?

113
00:08:00,970 --> 00:08:01,970
I told you, it's true!

114
00:08:02,440 --> 00:08:04,900
Mister, you're tied up because you did something bad, aren't you?

115
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:06,000
Something bad?

116
00:08:06,540 --> 00:08:07,080
Garant!

117
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:08,880
What are you grumbling about over there?!

118
00:08:09,200 --> 00:08:10,200
Pull!

119
00:08:13,980 --> 00:08:15,673
Stop rowing!

120
00:08:16,390 --> 00:08:18,060
Alright, you dogs, break time!

121
00:08:23,490 --> 00:08:24,720
I'm gonna eat!

122
00:08:24,835 --> 00:08:26,480
Make a noise and you'll pay for it!

123
00:08:26,815 --> 00:08:29,240
Hey, mister, what bad thing did you do?

124
00:08:29,900 --> 00:08:32,840
If you're really an angel, you should know the truth about everything.

125
00:08:33,139 --> 00:08:34,840
Whether we...

126
00:08:34,989 --> 00:08:35,989
...are good people...

127
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:37,080
...or bad guys.

128
00:08:37,205 --> 00:08:38,620
You should be able to tell.

129
00:08:38,909 --> 00:08:43,120
We just didn't bow, that's all.

130
00:08:45,109 --> 00:08:48,369
When Grand Duke Duralumin passed by, we didn't bow,

131
00:08:49,366 --> 00:08:51,620
so the soldiers caught us and put us in chains.

132
00:08:52,110 --> 00:08:53,613
Resume rowing!

133
00:08:54,520 --> 00:08:56,380
Row, you dogs!

134
00:08:56,879 --> 00:08:58,280
Come on, sing!

135
00:09:11,764 --> 00:09:15,220
Ah, something this terrible... how can I, an angel, just stay silent?

136
00:09:17,660 --> 00:09:19,120
No way!

137
00:09:20,280 --> 00:09:21,280
Ah!

138
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:22,200
No, no!

139
00:09:22,380 --> 00:09:23,633
I hate singing and dancing!

140
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:24,995
You can't do that!

141
00:09:25,020 --> 00:09:26,453
If you're invited, you have to dance!

142
00:09:27,460 --> 00:09:28,460
Sapphire!

143
00:09:34,609 --> 00:09:36,300
Hey there...

144
00:09:36,599 --> 00:09:37,620
What is it, Tink?

145
00:09:38,275 --> 00:09:39,460
There's big trouble!

146
00:09:40,020 --> 00:09:40,240
Huh?

147
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:41,480
What happened?

148
00:09:41,660 --> 00:09:42,840
Well, you see...

149
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:44,880
Stop singing that song!

150
00:09:46,460 --> 00:09:47,460
Ah!

151
00:09:53,580 --> 00:09:54,400
I said I don't want to!

152
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:55,440
Now see here!

153
00:09:58,629 --> 00:10:00,880
Please help those people!

154
00:10:06,340 --> 00:10:07,340
Stop it!

155
00:10:07,660 --> 00:10:08,660
No way!

156
00:10:15,080 --> 00:10:16,080
Princess Sapphire!

157
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:17,600
Princess Sapphire?

158
00:10:20,669 --> 00:10:21,900
I'm not a girl!

159
00:10:23,929 --> 00:10:25,560
You don't have to hide it from me.

160
00:10:25,775 --> 00:10:26,775
What did you say?

161
00:10:29,249 --> 00:10:30,280
You're a girl, aren't you?

162
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:31,520
I realized it while we were dancing.

163
00:10:31,860 --> 00:10:33,720
I told you to shut up, or I'll challenge you to a duel!

164
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:36,000
Draw your sword!

165
00:10:36,380 --> 00:10:37,500
No way, I don't want to fight!

166
00:10:37,970 --> 00:10:39,600
You were actually a girl!

167
00:10:40,560 --> 00:10:41,960
What? Did you say I was a girl?

168
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:42,760
A girl!

169
00:10:43,100 --> 00:10:44,100
What, a tomboy?!

170
00:10:45,885 --> 00:10:48,540
Sapphire, this is no time to fight!

171
00:10:53,239 --> 00:10:54,375
Such a tomboy for a girl!

172
00:10:54,400 --> 00:10:55,400
What?

173
00:10:56,609 --> 00:10:57,300
Tomboy!

174
00:10:57,580 --> 00:10:58,880
I told you I'm a guy!

175
00:10:59,800 --> 00:11:00,460
Delinquent!

176
00:11:00,655 --> 00:11:01,655
Bad boy!

177
00:11:01,880 --> 00:11:03,380
Now, now, you two!

178
00:11:03,920 --> 00:11:04,920
Get lost!

179
00:11:07,445 --> 00:11:12,620
Nylon, watch closely. Princess Sapphire's voice is starting to sound more and more like a woman's.

180
00:11:14,365 --> 00:11:17,260
I see. I wonder if he'll accidentally slip into talking like a woman.

181
00:11:22,677 --> 00:11:24,073
Two by two!

182
00:11:24,615 --> 00:11:25,615
Thank you, Little Angel!

183
00:11:25,900 --> 00:11:26,900
They're really off!

184
00:11:39,100 --> 00:11:40,100
I give up!

185
00:11:41,600 --> 00:11:42,760
What do you mean you give up?!

186
00:11:42,880 --> 00:11:43,980
Don't talk back to me!

187
00:11:44,790 --> 00:11:45,790
What did you do with the chain?!

188
00:11:55,770 --> 00:11:56,800
Now I've done it!

189
00:11:47,221 --> 00:11:49,401
Take that!

190
00:11:49,425 --> 00:11:51,218
Now's our chance!

191
00:12:06,996 --> 00:12:07,556
Just a minute.

192
00:12:07,580 --> 00:12:08,140
Now!

193
00:12:08,335 --> 00:12:09,335
Are you out of your mind?!

194
00:12:17,300 --> 00:12:18,300
Hey, watch out!

195
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:23,060
Who are you guys?!

196
00:12:23,260 --> 00:12:24,260
Shut up!

197
00:12:25,320 --> 00:12:26,780
Why are you being so violent?!

198
00:12:26,800 --> 00:12:27,800
Stop it!

199
00:12:27,824 --> 00:12:28,940
You think I'm gonna stop?!

200
00:12:29,040 --> 00:12:30,040
Prepare yourself!

201
00:12:30,365 --> 00:12:31,078
Watch out!

202
00:12:34,355 --> 00:12:35,780
Prince Sapphire, it's dangerous here!

203
00:12:36,060 --> 00:12:37,060
Run!

204
00:12:37,400 --> 00:12:37,926
Not a chance!

205
00:13:01,060 --> 00:13:02,060
Get them!

206
00:13:04,240 --> 00:13:05,540
Ah, soldiers!

207
00:13:05,660 --> 00:13:06,160
Damn it!

208
00:13:06,420 --> 00:13:07,420
Stop!

209
00:13:11,179 --> 00:13:12,179
Run to the stairs!

210
00:13:15,789 --> 00:13:17,200
We can throw soldiers out!

211
00:13:17,240 --> 00:13:18,240
Make a pitfall trap!

212
00:13:19,086 --> 00:13:19,875
Open up!

213
00:13:20,053 --> 00:13:20,942
Come out!

214
00:13:20,999 --> 00:13:21,999
Stop it!

215
00:13:22,213 --> 00:13:23,400
Not yet?

216
00:13:23,560 --> 00:13:24,560
Just a little more!

217
00:13:32,919 --> 00:13:33,919
Alright!

218
00:13:53,429 --> 00:13:54,340
We took care of the soldiers!

219
00:13:54,400 --> 00:13:55,400
Take it out!

220
00:13:55,425 --> 00:13:56,480
Yes!

221
00:14:07,300 --> 00:14:08,300
Damn it!

222
00:14:08,560 --> 00:14:09,560
There are still more of them?!

223
00:14:10,060 --> 00:14:13,260
You foolish slaves, do you think you can defeat me?!

224
00:14:14,929 --> 00:14:16,820
Things have gotten terrible, Princess Sapphire!

225
00:14:17,220 --> 00:14:19,286
I told you I'm not a princess, I'm a prince!

226
00:14:20,380 --> 00:14:21,380
I got it.

227
00:14:21,959 --> 00:14:23,940
But can we get out of here?

228
00:14:24,259 --> 00:14:26,860
Sapphire, they're fighting fiercely outside.

229
00:14:27,155 --> 00:14:28,806
I wonder what happened to that guy?

230
00:14:39,400 --> 00:14:40,400
Wait!

231
00:14:40,709 --> 00:14:41,940
Tink told me the reason!

232
00:14:42,280 --> 00:14:43,640
You can't kill those people!

233
00:14:44,545 --> 00:14:47,860
Well, well, Prince Sapphire, are you unharmed?

234
00:14:48,359 --> 00:14:50,220
Of course I wouldn't do such a thing.

235
00:14:50,340 --> 00:14:51,340
That's a promise!

236
00:14:51,390 --> 00:14:53,960
- You said you wouldn't kill them!
- Those people are good people!

237
00:14:53,985 --> 00:14:55,440
They just didn't bow!

238
00:14:55,441 --> 00:14:56,360
Who do you think you are?!

239
00:14:56,380 --> 00:14:57,380
Shut up!

240
00:15:10,559 --> 00:15:11,320
Nylon!

241
00:15:11,340 --> 00:15:12,060
It's time!

242
00:15:12,170 --> 00:15:13,220
Yes, sir!

243
00:15:13,520 --> 00:15:14,420
It's time for the execution!

244
00:15:14,460 --> 00:15:15,753
Fire!

245
00:15:24,081 --> 00:15:25,081
That sound!

246
00:15:25,819 --> 00:15:27,660
Isn't that the drum preparing for the execution?!

247
00:15:28,240 --> 00:15:29,240
Indeed!

248
00:15:29,395 --> 00:15:31,020
That wasn't the promise! You broke the promise!

249
00:15:31,740 --> 00:15:32,380
A promise?

250
00:15:32,575 --> 00:15:37,300
I don't recall making any such promise, but it's only natural that those guys be executed!

251
00:15:37,815 --> 00:15:39,200
Fine then, I'm going to tell Father on you!

252
00:15:39,460 --> 00:15:40,920
They say Grand Duke Duralumin is a liar!

253
00:15:41,265 --> 00:15:44,820
Go right ahead, I've already received the execution stamp anyway!

254
00:15:46,740 --> 00:15:48,560
Gather everyone in town!

255
00:15:48,650 --> 00:15:50,126
Show them the execution!

256
00:15:51,089 --> 00:15:52,775
What a terrible guy!

257
00:16:06,880 --> 00:16:07,880
Alright, watch this!

258
00:16:07,950 --> 00:16:08,950
I'm gonna give them a surprise!

259
00:16:10,180 --> 00:16:10,780
Hey!

260
00:16:11,180 --> 00:16:12,180
Prince Franz!

261
00:16:12,475 --> 00:16:13,560
I came chasing after you!

262
00:16:14,185 --> 00:16:16,060
Leave the dangerous stuff to the boys!

263
00:16:16,285 --> 00:16:18,440
I keep telling you, I'm a boy too! Alright?!

264
00:16:19,100 --> 00:16:21,180
It's fine, it's fine, just leave it to me!

265
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:22,360
You busybody!

266
00:16:24,200 --> 00:16:26,580
Wipe that look off your face!

267
00:16:48,830 --> 00:16:49,436
Hey!

268
00:16:49,460 --> 00:16:50,460
Sapphire!

269
00:16:57,019 --> 00:16:58,320
Do you have anything to say?

270
00:17:01,106 --> 00:17:02,106
Grand Duke Duralumin

271
00:17:02,800 --> 00:17:07,140
No matter how important you are, I won't bow to anyone who does bad things!

272
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:09,000
Not even if I die!

273
00:17:09,894 --> 00:17:11,073
Ready,

274
00:17:11,097 --> 00:17:12,500
launch!

275
00:17:15,560 --> 00:17:16,700
What happened?!

276
00:17:19,829 --> 00:17:20,859
There's no one here!

277
00:17:21,560 --> 00:17:22,040
No one?

278
00:17:22,300 --> 00:17:22,759
Idiot!

279
00:17:23,039 --> 00:17:24,972
As if a cannon could fire on its own!

280
00:17:25,380 --> 00:17:25,978
Search!

281
00:17:26,309 --> 00:17:27,380
Find the prisoner!

282
00:17:27,849 --> 00:17:29,335
There must be an intruder!

283
00:17:29,360 --> 00:17:30,360
Yes, sir!

284
00:17:40,820 --> 00:17:41,580
What is it?

285
00:17:41,740 --> 00:17:42,260
I don't know!

286
00:17:42,464 --> 00:17:44,420
If you're not busy, search for the intruder too!

287
00:17:44,445 --> 00:17:44,840
Yes, sir!

288
00:17:45,329 --> 00:17:46,380
What are you doing in a place like this?!

289
00:17:46,425 --> 00:17:47,425
I don't know!

290
00:17:53,332 --> 00:17:53,966
Alright.

291
00:17:57,679 --> 00:17:59,940
What on earth... what is going on?!

292
00:18:02,220 --> 00:18:02,840
What happened?!

293
00:18:02,980 --> 00:18:03,800
Even you?!

294
00:18:03,820 --> 00:18:04,460
I don't know!

295
00:18:04,638 --> 00:18:05,593
There's definitely someone here!

296
00:18:05,640 --> 00:18:06,125
Search!

297
00:18:06,150 --> 00:18:07,150
Drag them out!

298
00:18:23,700 --> 00:18:23,700
What?!

299
00:18:23,700 --> 00:18:23,700
What?!

300
00:18:30,385 --> 00:18:32,200
The ship started moving!

301
00:18:32,660 --> 00:18:33,660
It moved!

302
00:18:37,629 --> 00:18:39,320
It started moving all by itself!

303
00:18:39,540 --> 00:18:39,880
Stop it!

304
00:18:39,940 --> 00:18:41,000
Stop the ship!

305
00:18:44,686 --> 00:18:46,593
It's moving so fast!

306
00:18:49,989 --> 00:18:51,080
Who set the ship in motion?!

307
00:18:51,420 --> 00:18:51,855
Stop it!

308
00:18:51,880 --> 00:18:52,613
Stop it!

309
00:18:52,700 --> 00:18:53,660
We can't carry out the execution!

310
00:18:53,720 --> 00:18:54,720
Stop the ship!

311
00:18:55,384 --> 00:18:57,880
Why is it moving when there's no one down below?!

312
00:18:58,324 --> 00:18:59,360
I don't know!

313
00:18:59,529 --> 00:19:02,366
To think a ship could travel this fast!

314
00:19:02,625 --> 00:19:03,625
A ghost ship!

315
00:19:03,885 --> 00:19:05,224
A ghost ship?

316
00:19:05,446 --> 00:19:06,140
Foolishness!

317
00:19:06,260 --> 00:19:07,260
That's impossible!

318
00:19:07,840 --> 00:19:09,080
A ghost ship!

319
00:19:11,749 --> 00:19:12,749
This is getting interesting!

320
00:19:15,040 --> 00:19:16,040
Highness!

321
00:19:16,140 --> 00:19:17,346
Hang in there!

322
00:19:20,520 --> 00:19:21,126
That's right!

323
00:19:21,159 --> 00:19:22,880
The ghost fired the cannon too!

324
00:19:23,420 --> 00:19:24,035
Stop!

325
00:19:24,060 --> 00:19:25,800
There's no way a ghost would shoot a cannon!

326
00:19:26,144 --> 00:19:27,160
Here's a bonus!

327
00:19:28,640 --> 00:19:28,960
Hey!

328
00:19:29,100 --> 00:19:30,200
Listen, don't run away!

329
00:19:30,260 --> 00:19:31,260
Please!

330
00:19:32,100 --> 00:19:32,820
Stop dawdling!

331
00:19:32,900 --> 00:19:34,140
Chase that ghost ship!

332
00:19:34,414 --> 00:19:36,880
Understood, the ghost ship!

333
00:19:43,460 --> 00:19:44,460
Ready?

334
00:19:45,080 --> 00:19:45,520
Ready?

335
00:19:45,829 --> 00:19:47,060
Jump out on 1, 2, 3!

336
00:19:47,061 --> 00:19:48,095
There!

337
00:19:48,120 --> 00:19:49,520
Search starting from this room!

338
00:19:53,260 --> 00:19:54,260
Wh-Who is it?

339
00:19:54,809 --> 00:19:57,200
There's nobody here.

340
00:19:57,304 --> 00:19:59,580
N-N-N-Nobody, you say?

341
00:20:11,760 --> 00:20:12,960
Truth be told!

342
00:20:13,049 --> 00:20:14,200
We were the ghosts!

343
00:20:14,250 --> 00:20:15,040
Stop!

344
00:20:15,144 --> 00:20:16,840
Here's another bonus!

345
00:20:28,540 --> 00:20:28,940
Take that!

346
00:20:29,160 --> 00:20:29,840
1, 2, 3!

347
00:20:30,040 --> 00:20:31,040
Alright!

348
00:20:35,920 --> 00:20:36,695
Please wait!

349
00:20:36,720 --> 00:20:37,140
Please wait!

350
00:20:37,165 --> 00:20:37,895
Here you go!

351
00:20:37,920 --> 00:20:38,260
Thank you!

352
00:20:42,343 --> 00:20:43,622
It's all thanks to you.

353
00:20:45,209 --> 00:20:46,680
Playing ghost was fun, wasn't it!

354
00:20:47,145 --> 00:20:48,145
Let's do it again!

355
00:20:48,854 --> 00:20:50,720
Duralumin's ship is chasing us!

356
00:20:54,800 --> 00:20:55,180
Hey!

357
00:20:55,499 --> 00:20:57,060
Tink, I'm counting on you!

358
00:20:57,485 --> 00:20:59,044
Okay!

359
00:21:00,229 --> 00:21:01,260
Alright!

360
00:21:03,709 --> 00:21:04,880
Iruka-kun, I'm counting on you!

361
00:21:04,881 --> 00:21:05,881
Go!

362
00:21:17,220 --> 00:21:18,220
Dolphins?!

363
00:21:18,799 --> 00:21:20,380
Dolphins were pulling the ship?!

364
00:21:23,520 --> 00:21:24,300
Row!

365
00:21:24,340 --> 00:21:24,920
Row!

366
00:21:25,179 --> 00:21:26,355
We're almost catching up!

367
00:21:26,380 --> 00:21:27,380
Row!

368
00:21:48,860 --> 00:21:49,860
So fast!

369
00:21:50,780 --> 00:21:52,300
There's no way I can catch up!

370
00:21:53,080 --> 00:21:53,795
Everyone!

371
00:21:53,820 --> 00:21:54,820
Listen to me!

372
00:21:59,829 --> 00:22:02,780
We've had enough of bowing and scraping like we used to!

373
00:22:03,359 --> 00:22:05,942
From now on, we're heading out to sea to stretch our wings!

374
00:22:26,745 --> 00:22:27,665
Tink!

375
00:22:27,689 --> 00:22:29,846
I'm escorting you all the way to the sea!

376
00:22:30,039 --> 00:22:31,240
Leave it to me!

377
00:22:31,241 --> 00:22:32,940
Row!

378
00:22:36,280 --> 00:22:36,280
Pulley!

379
00:22:37,284 --> 00:22:43,386
Goodbye Prince Sapphire!

380
00:22:44,740 --> 00:22:46,840
You are a wonderful woman!

381
00:22:47,000 --> 00:22:47,600
Sapphire!

382
00:22:47,720 --> 00:22:48,920
Thank you!

383
00:22:49,259 --> 00:22:50,919
Goodbye!

384
00:23:04,099 --> 00:23:05,340
Well, I should head back too!

385
00:23:05,739 --> 00:23:06,760
Sapphire, see you later!

386
00:23:07,753 --> 00:23:08,220
Yeah!

387
00:23:08,245 --> 00:23:09,245
Let me see you again!

388
00:23:09,899 --> 00:23:11,480
Here, this is my present!

389
00:23:14,293 --> 00:23:14,924
Flowers?

390
00:23:14,949 --> 00:23:16,020
I don't need flowers!

391
00:23:16,239 --> 00:23:18,520
The language of this flower... is a secret!

392
00:23:19,000 --> 00:23:20,000
Goodbye!

393
00:23:21,500 --> 00:23:22,500
There go!

394
00:23:31,240 --> 00:23:32,240
A Secret.

395
00:23:32,264 --> 00:23:34,264

